  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Delivery Costs for Newton Fund ODA Eligible Activities</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Activity funded by the Newton Fund. Newton Fund activities must demonstrate that they will contribute to a reduction in poverty, and aim to further sustainable development (development that is likely to generate lasting benefits for the population of the country to which it is provided) or improve the welfare of the population of Newton Fund countries. The objective is to reduce poverty by generating and putting into use knowledge and technology to address development challenges and advance development for the poorest people and countries.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Newton Fund. AHRC Staff delivery costs for ODA eligible activities</narrative>
  </description>
